# The NON-GOOD half of finding PA-08-F8 of bd inc-tek.8.8: a fifth-level
# caster who is not good must still get everything the Staff of the Abyss
# grants. Read by tools/check_staff_abyss_alignment.sh.
#
# This half exists to catch an INVERTED gate. A gate written the wrong way
# round would suppress the staff for everyone who is NOT good, which locks
# out the very characters the item exists for and hands it to paladins. A
# check that measured only a good character could not tell that apart from a
# correct fix, because both leave the good character empty-handed.
#
# The character is the neutral orc mage tools/keys/chargen-mage.keys already
# builds. Neutral is the tighter of the two non-good readings: the page says
# "in the hands of a non-good caster", not "in the hands of an evil caster",
# so a gate that let evil through and stopped neutral would still be wrong
# and this session would still catch it.

@include chargen-mage.keys
@include staff-abyss-alignment-body.keys
